  "summary": "The term \"mangue\" was conceived by Chico Science, a pivotal figure in the movement, while \"beat\" was later appended by the media.",
  "description": "The term \"mangue\" was conceived by Chico Science, a pivotal figure in the movement, while \"beat\" was later appended by the media. Its core symbols include the crab, an animal central to the mangrove ecosystem, and a parabolic dish metaphorically \"stuck in the mud,\" symbolizing the fusion of traditional local culture with modern global influences. Individuals participating in Manguebeat are referred to as Manguegirls and Mangueboys .",
